### Orders. Placing an order reserves stock; cancelling returns it.
### The request names below let later requests reuse earlier responses (VS Code REST Client).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List orders (filters: status, customer_email, skip, limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=pending

### Place an order  -> 201, total_amount is computed server-side
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ama Mensah",
  "customer_email": "ama@example.com",
  "shipping_address": "12 Market Road, Bolgatanga",
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Get the order we just placed
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### More than available  -> 409 (nothing is reserved)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Kofi Boateng",
  "customer_email": "kofi@example.com",
  "items": [{ "product_id": 1, "quantity": 1000 }]
}

### Unknown product  -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Kofi Boateng",
  "customer_email": "kofi@example.com",
  "items": [{ "product_id": 99999, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Empty basket  -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer_name": "Kofi", "customer_email": "kofi@example.com", "items": [] }

### Confirm the order. Lifecycle: pending > confirmed > shipped > delivered
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ama Mensah",
  "customer_email": "ama@example.com",
  "shipping_address": "12 Market Road, Bolgatanga",
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Skip a state (confirmed > delivered)  -> 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ama Mensah",
  "customer_email": "ama@example.com",
  "status": "delivered"
}

### Cancel the order: stock goes back, order becomes final
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ama Mensah",
  "customer_email": "ama@example.com",
  "shipping_address": "12 Market Road, Bolgatanga",
  "status": "cancelled"
}

### Delete a cancelled (or pending) order  -> 204. Confirmed, shipped or delivered orders give 409.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Missing order  -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/99999
